  "citation": "Ciattaglia L; Rafanelli C; Rodriguez H; Araujo J (1997): Atmospheric CO2 Record from Continuous Measurements at Jubany Station, Antarctica (March 1994 - December 2009). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.015",
